# Documentation snippets extracted by `yarn docs:check` (RN-DOC1).
# The tsconfig and the prelude are checked in; the extracted samples are not.
docs-fixtures/*.ts
docs-fixtures/*.tsx
!docs-fixtures/prelude.d.ts

# --- public deliverables that a developer's global gitignore may hide ---
# Public docs ship; internal / planning notes never do. The re-exclusions must
# stay after the negations.
!docs/
docs/internal/
ACCEPTANCE_CRITERIA.md
# Secret-scanner guard tests (they contain no secret values).
!**/__tests__/secrets.test.ts
# The example backend's source lives in `lib/` (the root `lib/` rule is for build output).
!example/backend/lib/
